{
  "name": "Pugilist",
  "type": "class",
  "img": "icons/equipment/hand/gauntlet-simple-leather-brown-gold.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>I didn’t hear no bell.</strong></p><p><em>—Rocky Balboa, Rocky V</em></p><p>Pugilists are brawlers of swagger. While a monk may dedicate themself to a single focused blow, a pugilist will break their fingers and keep punching with the bloody stump.</p><h3>Iconic Pugilists</h3><ul><li><strong>Carl</strong>, <em>Dungeon Crawler Carl</em></li><li><strong>Rocky Balboa</strong>, <em>Rocky</em></li><li><strong>Hellboy</strong>, <em>Hellboy</em></li><li><strong>Stiffener Medick</strong>, <em>Redwall</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Pugilist</h3><p>Pugilists are frontline bruisers. Stay in the frontline, even while at low HP.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Attack (Brawl)<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Frontline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Brawler or Monk<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Might<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★☆☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Brawl, Influence</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Fisticuffs, Rope-a-Dope</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Haymaker (10+)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Moxie (Cd4)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Title Holder (d6)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Haymaker (9+)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Moxie (Cd6), Title Holder (d8)</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "isSpellcaster": false,
    "levelFeatures": [
      {
        "level": 1,
        "name": "Fisticuffs",
        "description": "<p>You have the Dusted Knuckle Perk (p. 68), and your Equipped Brawl Weapons have the Defense and Vicious properties.</p><p>Further, when you roll any damage dice for a Brawl Weapon, you can either:</p><ul><li><p>Increase your subsequent Brawl damage dice one size until the start of your Turn.</p></li><li><p>Grapple or Shove them if you viably could.</p></li></ul>",
        "statBonusPoints": 0,
        "extraTraining": 0,
        "requiredSpells": [],
        "allowedPerks": [
          "Compendium.vagabond.perks.Item.Lb1ncXSPRRd1wq84"
        ],
        "perkAmount": 1,
        "spellAmount": 0,
        "skillChoices": []
      },
      {
        "level": 1,
        "name": "Rope-a-Dope",
        "description": "<p>If you reduce damage from a Close Enemy’s attack to 0 with the Defense property of a Brawl Weapon, you can immediately make one attack or Move 5’ without using Speed.</p>",
        "statBonusPoints": 0,
        "extraTraining": 0,
        "requiredSpells": [],
